            "
          >
            Long story short
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
  padding="14px 12px 0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 1px;
    "
  >
    Global Affairs
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>A Nigerian military airstrike hit Tumfa market in Zamfara State, killing at least 100 civilians, according to Amnesty International. </strong>The rights group said many of the dead were women and girls, and called for an immediate investigation into what it described as reckless attacks on civilians. The Red Cross also confirmed civilian deaths, while community leaders said dozens of injured people were being treated in nearby hospitals (<a href="https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-airstrike-kills-100-at-market-amnesty-says/a-77135993" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">market strike</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Nauru will hold a referendum on changing its official name to “Naoero,” after parliament passed a constitutional amendment backing the move. </strong>The government says “Nauru” came from foreign mispronunciation of the island’s native name and sees the change as a way to reclaim its heritage, language, and identity. The name Naoero comes from “Dorerin Naoero,” the native language spoken by many citizens alongside English (<a href="https://www.dw.com/en/nauru-change-name-naoero-referendum/a-77140283" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">island identity</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Business &amp; Markets
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Anduril Industries has raised $5B in its latest funding round, doubling its valuation to $61B. </strong>The round was led by Thrive Capital and Andreessen Horowitz, showing continued investor appetite for defense technology start-ups. The California-based company said its revenue more than doubled to $2.2B in 2025, while its workforce nearly doubled over the past year (<a href="https://www.msn.com/en-ca/general/general/us-defense-firm-anduril-raises-5-billion-doubling-its-valuation-to-61-billion/ar-AA234wLq?ocid=BingNewsSerp" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Anduril boom</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Walmart has cut 1,000 jobs as it simplifies its operating structure and pushes deeper into technology, marketplace, and delivery growth. </strong>Under CEO John Furner, the retailer is reorganizing teams around a single shared platform instead of separate structures for Walmart US, Sam’s Club, and international markets. Executives said the changes are meant to clarify ownership and better match roles with future skills (<a href="https://www.msn.com/en-ca/money/general/walmart-cuts-1-000-roles-to-simplify-operations-source-says/ar-AA235KBp?ocid=BingNewsSerp" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">retail reset</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Brown-Forman, the maker of Jack Daniel’s, has reportedly rejected a $15B takeover proposal from rival Sazerac. </strong>The bid valued Brown-Forman at $32 per share and was backed by Wells Fargo and Apollo Global Management. Under the proposal, Class A shareholders could either sell for currency or roll their shares into a newly formed company. The rejection comes shortly after Brown-Forman and Pernod Ricard ended separate merger talks over agreement structure and monetary conditions (<a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/news/jack-daniels-maker-brown-forman-111038285.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">bourbon bid</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Science &amp; Tech
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="0px 12px 10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Science &amp; Tech"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Google previewed a wave of Android updates at The Android Show, led by Gemini Intelligence, Googlebooks, Android 17 features, and deeper AI tools across devices. </strong>Googlebooks are laptops built for Gemini and designed to work closely with Android phones. Gemini Intelligence will help automate tasks, create widgets, fill forms, and provide contextual suggestions. Android 17 will add 3D emoji, smarter speech-to-text, Pause Point, creator tools, improved iPhone switching, and AirDrop-style Quick Share (<a href="https://www.engadget.com/2171038/everything-announced-at-android-show-google-io-2026/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Android overload</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Researchers have developed a quantum-inspired algorithm that can rapidly simulate extremely complex quantum materials, </strong>including topological quasicrystals and super-moiré structures. These materials are difficult to model because their non-periodic patterns can require enormous calculations beyond supercomputers. Instead of directly calculating every part of the material, the team used tensor-network methods similar to quantum computing approaches, allowing them to simulate a quasicrystal with over 268Mn sites (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/05/260512202355.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">tensor trick</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Whatnot
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Lula scraps unpopular import tax in pre-election shift (<a href="https://chinaglobalsouth.com/2026/05/13/brazil-lula-ecommerce-tax-reversal/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">import reversal</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Google and SpaceX in talks to put data centers into orbit (<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/12/report-google-and-spacex-in-talks-to-put-data-centers-into-orbit/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">orbit farms</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Your “um” and pauses could reveal early dementia risk (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/05/260512202333.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">memory markers</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Visualizing the hantavirus cruise outbreak (<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/us/maps-hantavirus-cruise-outbreak-vis" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">ship spread</a>).</p>
</mj-text>

